# Product / UX standing preferences

- Use open source (or a reputable free tier of an OSS product) before building commodity systems: analytics, charts, email, CMS, search, observability.
- Custom code is for FindMyInvite-specific invitation experience, not Mixpanel clones.
- Keep `/akay` unlinked from public pages if it remains.
- Do not store analytics events in the guest invitations database.
- Hosts sign in with email and password to save a draft or publish. Forgot password is backlog; do not build it until Ashok asks.
